#TITANIC SURVIVAL PREDICTION
THIS PROJECT USES MACHINE LEARNING TO WHETHER A PASSENGER SURVIVED
THE TITANIC DISASTER BASED ON PASSENGER INFORMATION.
#TECHNOLOGY USED
PYTHON
PANDAS
SCIKIT LEARN
MATPLOTLIB
#FEATURES
DATA LOADING AND PREPROCESSING
HANDLING MISSING VALUES
FEATURES SELECTION
MODEL TRAINING
SURVIVAL PREDICTION
MODEL ACCURACY EVALUATION
CLASSIFICATION REPORT AND CONFUSION MATRIX
#PROJECT GOAL
THE GOAL OF THIS PROJECT IS TO BUILD A MACHINE LEARNING
MODEL THAT PREDICT THE SURVIVAL TITANIC PASSENGERS
BASED ON FEATURES SUCH AS 
AGE,GENDER,PASSENGER CLASS,FARE AND OTHER RELEVANT INFORMATION.
